<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets calls on car sector basket.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets calls on car sector basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products has issued two million European-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on a basket of Japanese car firms, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>The basket includes one share each of Honda, Isuzu, Nissan, Toyota and Mitsubishi Motors.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE WARRANT CONTROLS ONE BASKET.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	09.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   US$1.0=113.5 YEN</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>		STRIKE	 ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL A     8,374 YEN     $7.617</p>
<p> CALL B     9,607.4 YEN   $5.215</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
